{"id": "sevt_01534PFKeoeWBb4UxfzHgsZE", "input": {"command": "cd /mnt/session/uploads; python3 - <<'E'\nimport json,collections\nc=collections.Counter();ex=None;lv=collections.Counter();dur=[]\nfor l in open('app.log'):\n    try:d=json.loads(l)\n    except:continue\n    if d['service']!='checkout':continue\n    m=d['msg']\n    if 'order_items' in m:\n        k='perrow' if 'order_id = ?' in m else 'batch'\n        b='post' if d['ts']>='2026-04-22T14:46:05' else 'pre'\n        c[(k,b)]+=1\n        if k=='perrow' and not ex:ex=l\n    if d['ts']>='2026-04-22T14:46' and d['level'] in('ERROR','WARN'):lv[m[:80]]+=1\nprint(c);print(ex);print(lv.most_common(5))\n# queries per request post-deploy\nr=collections.Counter()\nfor l in open('app.log'):\n    if 'order_id = ?' in l:\n        r[json.loads(l)['request_id']]+=1\nprint(len(r),sorted(r.values())[-5:], sum(r.values())/max(len(r),1))\nE"}, "name": "bash", "processed_at": "2026-10-14T06:01:16.607545Z", "type": "agent.tool_use", "evaluated_permission": "allow", "evaluation": {"type": "always_allow"}, "session_thread_id": null}
